{"id":"n28562-4-8","stage":2,"title":"넘기다 · 翻","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28562-4-8-1","ko":"이 페이지를 보면 되나요?","zh":"看这一页就可以了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"페이지를","meaning":"页","explanation":"페이지：页；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"페이지","audio":"/audio/6c84a1b3b066b74c6479.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81961","senseId":"1","lemma":"페이지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보면","meaning":"试，试图","explanation":"보다：试，试图；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"6c84a1b3b066b74c","term":"페이지","zh":"页","audio":"/audio/6c84a1b3b066b74c6479.mp3","entryId":"81961","definition":"书籍、报纸、文件等的一面。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试，试图","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示试着做前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7903407491d93fb6b4c0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28562-4-8-2","ko":"그다음 쪽으로 넘기세요.","zh":"请翻到下一页吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그다음","meaning":"之后，